Package: fellowship-nas-web
Architecture: any
Depends: fellowship-nas-tools (= ${source:Version}), libpam-runtime, adduser, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: fellowship-desktop
Replaces: fellowship-desktop
Description: FellowshipNAS desktop in the browser
 A web server, written for FellowshipNAS, that serves a windowed desktop for
 managing storage, shares, health and alerts. The part facing the network runs
 without special rights; a small helper checks passwords with PAM and runs
 fnas for members of the nas-admins group.
